 los límites del mandato. En rangeaudit_synthesis se articulan con nitidez los hallazgos documentales, los supuestos de especificación y los límites derivados de la ausencia de ejecuciones en measured-test-records.json, integrando alternativas explicativas ante posibles discrepancias sin prejuzgar resultados ni atribuir efectos de campo o superioridad. En rangeaudit_uncertainty se delimita explícitamente la incertidumbre empírica, aclarando que la falta de mediciones no presupone incumplimiento ni tasa cero, y explicitando sesgos de selección y riesgos metodológicos del oráculo sin exceder los datos disponibles. Las dependencias y versiones son íntegras y no se detectan hallazgos adversos.","receipt_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-07/transport/host-journal/role-11-explain-review/receipt.json","source_files_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","source_fingerprint":"336121f7803d361037df32352d0174f66933390e5ac3bdea52698c6edfad8843","source_phase_snapshot":"95816f114c6931d7607b135b7f865ec822c6398fa7525144fbeeb1bb617a69af","usage_reported":{"cache_read_tokens":0,"input_tokens":24692,"output_tokens":1229,"thinking_tokens":1037,"total_tokens":25921},"verdict":"accept"},{"action":"author","actor":"agent:codex-isolated-author","admitted":false,"cost":null,"derived_manifest_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-07/controller/role-artifacts/role-12-compare-author-manifest.json","derived_manifest_sha256":"892175ec91cf69bfaf1e4f54cf0b7ee5f5e7e09e7600f9d31d6c2e1069e69461","findings":[],"job_id":"role-12-compare-author","phase":"compare","raw_packet_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-07/controller/role-artifacts/role-12-compare-author-packet.json","raw_packet_sha256":"b193219e6afbd510e02e914b81586fb6674f5ac47869e12586d5710002867